        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "v. While participating a function for 3 or more than 3 days, an authorization letter regarding the provision of basic needs (food, water and residence) to the elephant should have already been obtained from the function organizers and enclo"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e48d3e3290e84ef29df93a1ba08b558a_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "vi. There should be two days interval in between two functions for which one permit is issued."
      },
      {
